1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Commander gets complicated. Keeping track of it should not.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Meet BoardState Lite, your intelligent companion for physical Commander.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Track life, see every change, and keep the game in view.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:34,000
When an effect applies to every creature, Lite handles the bookkeeping automatically.

5
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Swipe into Ability Focus to see what your permanents can do.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Activate an ability, and Lite remembers the usage that matters across your recorded turns.

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Made a mistake? Review the action, undo it, and keep playing.

8
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Track Initiative and dungeon progress in the same place.

9
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,500
Less bookkeeping. More Magic. BoardState Lite.
